Identifier: "AlpsTpchMetrics"
DisplayName: "ALPS TPC-H Metrics"
Description: "All GB200 counters and launch attributes collected by the ALPS TPC-H NCU campaign."
Order: 1000

# Exact metric suffixes resolved with Nsight Compute 2025.3.1 on NVIDIA GB200.
